    </div>

    <h2>Editorial values</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Plainspoken. Skeptical. Funny when the absurdity earns it. Rigorous. Politically awake.</li>
      <li>A citation supports the point — it doesn't become the personality.</li>
      <li>No manufactured "both sides" paragraph when the evidence supports a conclusion.</li>
      <li>Necessary nuance stays. Cowardly hedging goes.</li>
    </ul>

